      "sha256": "43a0c17fd085991b71f103950140b8f8a17ceb3c1bb5e25cc72fd6335b1987e3",
      "note": "linked in issue #445; table 7 (Modbus table) and the bit masks after it"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU over RS485. Defaults: address 1, 19200 baud, no parity, response delay 10 ms.",
    "The manual lists the registers as 40001 on; the map uses 40001 less one, as sent on the wire. The manual's offset column is wrong for the alarm blocks and the analog output (it counts each block of 16 as one).",
    "Weights are signed 16-bit integers with the decimal places in register 40007.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "databits": 8,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
